  "notes": [
    "-IR verb with e→i stem change (#stem_e_i)",
    "Stem changes in Presente: all forms except nosotros (despido, despides, despide, despiden)",
    "In Pretérito Indefinido: e→i in él/ella/usted (despidió) and ellos/ellas/ustedes (despidieron)",
    "Same e→i change in gerund: despidiendo",
    "Past participle: despedido (regular)",
    "Two main meanings: (1) to say goodbye to someone: despedir a alguien = to see someone off; (2) to fire/dismiss from a job",
    "The reflexive \"despedirse de\" = to say goodbye to, to take leave of"
